@startuml
title Component Lifecycle State Machine

[*] --> Declared
Declared --> Fetched : fetch source
Fetched --> CheckedOut : checkout revision
CheckedOut --> Patched : apply manifest patch series
Patched --> Configured : backend configure
Configured --> Built : backend build
Built --> Deployed : copy declared artifacts
Deployed --> Verified : run artifact verifiers
Verified --> [*]

Fetched --> Failed : clone failure
CheckedOut --> Failed : revision missing or dirty tree
Patched --> Failed : patch rejects
Configured --> Failed : missing tool or defconfig failure
Built --> Failed : upstream build failure
Deployed --> Failed : missing artifact or copy failure
Verified --> Failed : verifier failure

Failed --> [*]

note right of Failed
Failure output must include component,
phase, command, working directory,
log path, and error class.
end note

@enduml

